SUMMARY:Great Reads from Great Places “National Book Festival Near You” Author Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us online on August 4\, 2026 for a virtual conversation with our Great Reads from Great Places adult book author to explore stories from Stronger Than the Storm: Hurricane Helene in Western North Carolina. Register using the link below. \nNC Humanities’ Great Read from Great Places books and authors are featured on the Library of Congress’ national reading list and highlighted at the National Book Festival. The list is composed of books and authors from each state and territory affiliate Center for the Book to showcase the rich culture and heritage of our country.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/great-reads-from-great-places-festival-near-you-author-event/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:NC Humanities Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/10.png
END:VEVENT
