SUMMARY:First Friday Ice Cream Social
DESCRIPTION:Get to know your neighbors and the Pope Family with free ice cream!\nThe Ice cream social will feature a display discussing future plans of the Pope House Museum\, South Park Heritage Trail\, and John P. “Top” Greene African American Cultural Center. \nDetails\nLocation: Pope House Museum\nDate: Aug. 7\nTime: 5:30 – 8 p.m.\nAges: All\nCost: Free
