SUMMARY:Lunchbox Lecture: Lisa Grele Barrie
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh City Farm: Growing and Sustaining a Nonprofit Urban Farm\nLisa Grele Barrie is the Executive Director of Raleigh City Farm and is passionate about sustaining this very special urban green space. In this talk\, she will share the founding story of the Farm and the mission and strategy for future endeavors.
